1tp|n|Consisting of air; as, an airy substance; the airy parts of bodies. ; Relating or belonging to air; high in air; aerial; as, an airy flight. ; Open to a free current of air; exposed to the air; breezy; as, an airy situation. ; Resembling air; thin; unsubstantial; not material; airlike. ; Relating to the spirit or soul; delicate; graceful; as, airy music. ; Without reality; having no solid foundation; empty; trifling; visionary. ; Light of heart; vivacious; sprightly; flippant; superficial. ; Having an affected manner; being in the habit of putting on airs; affectedly grand. ; Having the light and aerial tints true to nature.	N:1gwb,62,4;tov,23,1~1gwb,62,4;tov,23,1
